onent values are first-pass; every timing and threshold is to be measured per docs/14 9 before the board goes into the chassis."(at 15 280 0)(effects(font(size 1.4 1.4))(justify left))(uuid 12403ef2-7ecc-5501-94c6-4770607ed7d6))(sheet_instances(path "/"(page "1"))))
